== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Mercurius|Mercurius]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* Mercurius' effects reference the Roman god of travel and communication, [[wikipedia:Mercury (mythology)|Mercury]], who wore winged shoes and a winged hat.
* Mercurius is the biggest static speed upgrade in the game.
* Despite Mercurius preventing doors from closing, the sound of doors opening can still be heard after clearing a room with enemies.

